[00:00.00] 作词 : Daniel Nigro/Olivia Rodrigo/Amy Allen
[00:00.00][by:维尔日记]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Daniel Nigro/Olivia Rodrigo/Amy Allen
[00:11.89]My day was so mundane
[00:11.89]我的一天如此乏味
[00:13.72]I don’t think I left the house
[00:13.72]好像门都没出过
[00:17.78]Drank a pot of coffee
[00:17.78]喝了一整壶咖啡
[00:20.05]Tried to write, nothing came out
[00:20.05]试着写点什么 脑子却一片空白
[00:23.60]Somehow it’s the weekend
[00:23.60]不知怎么就到了周末
[00:25.58]I’m still bored out of my skull
[00:25.58]我还是无聊得要命
[00:29.43]And I went to a party
[00:29.43]我去了那个派对
[00:31.42]But only on principle
[00:31.42]但也只是走个过场罢了
[00:34.61]Empty, look at me
[00:34.61]内心空洞 看看我
[00:40.46]I’m a zombie in my body
[00:40.46]我就像具行尸走肉
[00:43.35]I’m a train off of the track
[00:43.35]像一列脱轨的火车
[00:46.40]I feel dirty, I feel rotten
[00:46.40]无比肮脏 腐烂至极
[00:49.26]And the colors are all flat
[00:49.26]眼前色彩全都黯淡
[00:52.30]I’m a sad shell of a woman
[00:52.30]徒留一副悲哀的空壳
[00:54.98]And I’ve got maggots for brains
[00:54.98]蛆虫爬满我的大脑
[00:58.08]But that’s just the thing that happens
[00:58.08]但这就是会发生的事
[01:00.98]When my
[01:00.98]当我的
[01:02.72]When my baby goes away
[01:02.72]当我的宝贝离去时
