[01:08.38]当我的宝贝离去时
[01:13.65]He goes away
[01:13.65]他离去时
[01:16.14]Everything feels moldy
[01:16.14]一切都发霉变质
[01:18.66]Like the fruit that’s in my fridge
[01:18.66]像冰箱里的水果般
[01:22.27]And everything that’s funny
[01:22.27]我多希望能
[01:24.36]I wish I could tell to him
[01:24.36]给他讲那些趣事
[01:27.63]And sometimes at a low point
[01:27.63]有时在难过的时候
[01:30.15]I even wish for a tragedy
[01:30.15]我竟还会期盼悲剧降临
[01:33.40]‘Cause I know he’d come over
[01:33.40]因为我知道他会赶来
